<title>CHILE: Chile November wholesale prices rise 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Chile November wholesale prices rise 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean wholesale prices rose 0.1 percent in November compared with an increase of 0.9 percent in the same month last year, said the National Statistics Institute.</p>
<p>Wholesale prices have risen 3.6 percent in the first 11 months of 1996 and 3.5 percent over the last 12 months.</p>
<p>Domestic product prices fell 0.3 percent last month, while the price of imported products increased 1.2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago Newsroom 562-699-5595x212</p>
